+// True when a physical device exposes a Vulkan Video decode extension. The
+// embedded streamer's shared device exists to decode with Vulkan Video, so on a
+// board that decodes through V4L2 Request or VA-API the probe has nothing to
+// build and only reports that the expected feature is missing. Asking first
